<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-CRA sells Century project. [CORRECTED 22:32 GMT]</title>
<headline>RTRS-CRA sells Century project. [CORRECTED 22:32 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global mining house RTZ-CRA said on Thursday that it would sell its Century zinc project in the Australian state of Queensland to Pasminco Ltd for A$345 million. (Corrects headline and text to show CRA is selling the project, not acquiring it.)</p>
</text>
